Supplier Management Module

The Supplier Management Module manages supplier information used by the municipality.

Implemented in supplier and supplier.

Supplier Information Stored
Supplier ID
Supplier Name
Supplier Email
Supplier Phone Number
Supplier Location

Supplier Features
CRUD Operations
Add Supplier
Display Suppliers
Search Supplier
Update Supplier
Delete Supplier

Search Options

Suppliers may be searched using:

Supplier ID
Supplier Name

Update Options

Users may update:

Supplier Name
Supplier Email
Supplier Phone Number
Supplier Location

Validation

The system validates:

Supplier ID
Supplier Name
Email Address
Phone Number
Location

Supplier Reports
Complete Supplier Listing
Supplier Location Report
Total Supplier Report

Supplier File Handling

Supplier data is stored in:

Plain Text
supplier.txt

